VALUES (1456928, 'tt37271308', NULL, 'I Would Rather Kill You', '차라리 죽여', 'movie', 2025, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3z8uYRLVLiz9LXp62GoQ0AFPZR.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5NzHayF1hrTqpHNmqVfnN0mPxDi.jpg', 'After leaving behind the hectic city life, sisters Sun-young and Ji-young move to a secluded rural village. Sun-young, the older sister, is practical and responsible, while Ji-young is carefree and detached. Dae-geun, the passionate youth leader who works tirelessly for the happiness and prosperity of the village, and Bong-sam, the village chief, both fall head over heels for the sisters who bring a fiery energy to their once-quiet town. Other suspicious men begin to obsess over the sisters, including a wanted criminal who causes a stir in the village. One man after another, the village''s men fall into the wild trap of desire.', NULL, NULL, 14.9599, 6.8, 0, 10.27, '2026-08-19 01:49:52', '2026-10-25 13:20:37')
